{
  "name": "Map the buying committee at target accounts with emails and mobiles using LeadMagic",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Buying committee builder\n\n### How it works\n1. List target account domains in **Target accounts**.\n2. People Search finds senior people across the departments in your buying committee.\n3. Email Finder gets each verified work email; VP-level and above also get a mobile number.\n4. One row per person is saved to a sheet.\n\n### Setup\n1. Edit **Target accounts**.\n2. Paste a sheet URL into **Save committee**.\n3. Select your LeadMagic and Google Sheets credentials.\n\n### Customization\nChange departments and seniority in **Find committee**. Mobile Finder is the costliest step, so it only runs for VP and above.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "720d9806-9664-520a-bd3d-38f3df367c53",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b415525a-bc98-53d1-a0c1-1788aa30fe91",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"domains\": [\"example.com\", \"example.org\"]\n}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d59f1c48-8ec2-55d3-96be-8abb049e9668",
      "name": "Target accounts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "domains",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "67b0d8d2-6418-5e83-bb6d-27e8e090cdad",
      "name": "One item per account",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "people",
        "operation": "searchPeople",
        "company_domain": "={{ $json.domains }}",
        "peopleFilters": {
          "contact_job_function": [
            "Sales",
            "Marketing",
            "Operations",
            "Information Technology"
          ],
          "min_seniority": 3,
          "include_company": false
        },
        "limit": 12
      },
      "id": "25333163-46ba-55a6-9180-005d35c9988e",
      "name": "Find committee",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "findEmail",
        "findBy": "profile",
        "profile_url": "={{ $json.contact_linkedin_url }}",
        "outputMode": "selected",
        "outputFields": [
          "email",
          "status"
        ]
      },
      "id": "856a8389-082b-50ee-8990-4ecfdd4717c0",
      "name": "Find work email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.seniority_score }}",
              "rightValue": 4,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "058adf5e-a261-51ea-a74c-5a42d5012486",
      "name": "VP or above?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "profile",
        "operation": "findMobile",
        "searchMethod": "profile",
        "profile_url": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.contact_linkedin_url }}",
        "outputMode": "selected",
        "outputFields": [
          "mobile_number"
        ]
      },
      "id": "a2cc40c3-11bb-5627-9f7c-4c0a9e4cab10",
      "name": "Find mobile",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0",
              "name": "Account",
              "value": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.company_domain }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "Name",
              "value": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.contact_full_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "Title",
              "value": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.contact_job_title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "Department",
              "value": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.contact_job_function }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "Email",
              "value": "={{ $('Find work email').item.json.status === 'valid' ? $('Find work email').item.json.email : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "Mobile",
              "value": "={{ $json.mobile_number ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a6",
              "name": "Profile URL",
              "value": "={{ $('Find committee').item.json.contact_linkedin_url }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
